            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Reason this is non-trivial is the arg to these addalls can be of differnt shape, handled by the Add overloading.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "So must add an Add_ method taking a _SafeReadWriteRepAccessor and so parallel overloading.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Easy and probably modestly significant performance boost for relatively common case (cuz used in CTORs).",
                     "type" : "text"
